  "answer": "An employee has 7 working days to file a disciplinary appeal. The code of conduct for travel expenses states that per diem allowances vary by region: Europe - 60 USD per day, Asia - 45 USD per day, Americas - 65 USD per day, Middle East and Africa - 50 USD per day. On the day of departure and return, half of the per diem is paid, and meals provided by a host or included in a conference fee reduce the per diem by 20 USD per meal.",
