      "locator": "section '10. Disciplinary appeals'",
      "quote": "An employee may appeal against any disciplinary sanction in writing within 7 working days of receiving the decision, stating the grounds of appeal."
    },
    {
      "doc": "code_of_conduct_travel_expenses.md",
      "locator": "section 'B4. Per diem allowances'",
      "quote": "A daily per diem covers meals and incidental expenses when travelling overnight: - Europe: 60 USD per day. - Asia: 45 USD per day. - Americas: 65 USD per day. - Middle East and Africa: 50 USD per day. On the day of departure and the day of return, half of the per diem is paid. Meals provided by a host or included in a conference fee reduce the per diem by 20 USD per meal."
